[debug] Processing with CmsHarness.Web.HooksController.handle/2
  Parameters: %{"cwd" => "/Users/johndavenport/Documents/github/code_my_spec/.claude/worktrees/phx-new-generator", "effort" => %{"level" => "xhigh"}, "harness_id" => "6bc4851f-f735-4590-bb1c-c660619b4019", "hook_event_name" => "PreToolUse", "permission_mode" => "auto", "prompt_id" => "3a7a5e8a-b1cb-4155-a6f2-087be6efc8a0", "session_id" => "80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37", "tool_input" => %{"file_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/Documents/github/code_my_spec/.claude/worktrees/phx-new-generator/lib/mix/tasks/cms.harness.onboard.ex", "new_string" => "  ## What gets minted\n\n  A harness config at the working copy's root — `CmsHarness.HarnessConfig` —\n  holding the id the server issued, the project it serves, and where it is. The\n  server records the same root on the harness object.\n\n  That file is why nothing has to be discovered afterwards. A working copy\n  knows where it is; writing that down when its identity is minted removes\n  every mechanism that previously guessed — the walk up to the nearest\n  `mix.exs`, the list of directories in the environment, the lookup against the\n  server.\n\n  Asking the server for the id rather than waiting for a channel join is what\n  lets a brand-new worktree be onboarded before anything has ever run in it.\n  \"\"\"", "old_string" => "  ## The id\n\n  Taken from `.cms_harness_id` if the checkout has one, and asked of the server\n  if it does not — the server issues it, the checkout keeps it, and the file is\n  gitignored so a clone is correctly a new working copy rather than a second\n  one wearing this identity.\n\n  Asking rather than waiting for a channel join matters: the harness learns\n  which copies to serve by looking ids up, so a copy with no id would never be\n  served and would never acquire one. This is what breaks that circle, and it\n  is why a brand-new worktree can be onboarded before anything has ever run in\n  it.\n  \"\"\"", "replace_all" => false}, "tool_name" => "Edit", "tool_use_id" => "toolu_01XNNDoC2UGqaD2icovkzmxp", "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec--claude-worktrees-phx-new-generator/80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37.jsonl"}
