[debug] Processing with CmsHarness.Web.HooksController.handle/2
  Parameters: %{"cwd" => "/Users/johndavenport/Documents/github/code_my_spec/.claude/worktrees/phx-new-generator", "effort" => %{"level" => "xhigh"}, "harness_id" => "6bc4851f-f735-4590-bb1c-c660619b4019", "hook_event_name" => "PreToolUse", "permission_mode" => "auto", "prompt_id" => "3a7a5e8a-b1cb-4155-a6f2-087be6efc8a0", "session_id" => "80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37", "tool_input" => %{"command" => "git add -A && git commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nMint a harness config that says where the working copy is\n\nOnboarding writes .cms_harness.json at the copy's root: its harness id,\nits project, and its path. The server records the same root on the\nharness object.\n\nThat file is why nothing has to be discovered. Three mechanisms have\ntried to answer \"where is this working copy\" and each was wrong in its\nown way — walking up to the nearest mix.exs resolved one session\ndifferently depending on the subdirectory and resolved a nested checkout\nto the outer one; a list of directories in the environment put the\noperator back in the business of registering paths; a lookup against the\nserver made the harness unable to answer until the network came up, to\nfetch a fact the checkout already had.\n\nA working copy knows where it is. Writing that down when its identity is\nminted removes all three, so CMS_PROJECT_DIRS, start_configured and the\nwhole notion of configured project directories are gone.\n\nOnboarding also asks the server for an id when a checkout has none.\nWaiting for a channel join could not work: a copy is served by looking\nits id up, so a copy with no id would never be served and would never\nacquire one. That circle is why a fresh worktree could not be onboarded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JPoSfcCJqSqG8iGY9nfyfL\nEOF\n)\" && git log --oneline -1", "description" => "Commit the harness config design"}, "tool_name" => "Bash", "tool_use_id" => "toolu_01DCakSrTXRWUtUJUtmPMVvb", "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec--claude-worktrees-phx-new-generator/80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37.jsonl"}
  Pipelines: [:hook]
